{"id":40,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と主体性を六年間で育む九段中等","feature_description":"千代田区立九段中等教育学校は「学ぶ・生きる・鍛える」を柱に、リベラルアーツと探究学習を基本とする6年間一貫のカリキュラムを編成します。九段探究プランや体験活動を通して、自主自律、他者への思いやり、問いを立て深く探究する力、グローバルマインドを育てる方針を令和8年度学校経営方針で示しています。前期課程では基礎力と探究の芽を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":1668,"name":"前期サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/134766417","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1669,"name":"後期男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/135364880","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1670,"name":"後期課程女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/2011573","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1671,"name":"前期男女バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/2010805","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1672,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/2010541","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1673,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/2011326","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1674,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/2011093","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1675,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/130159747","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1676,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/94476900","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1677,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/2011183","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1678,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/135715703","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1679,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kudan.ed.jp/school/weblog/2011255","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1680,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kudan